<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Discorporation</ansi> mutation

Your body stops being quite real — you are more presence than flesh,
and blades pass through the blur of you.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Transformation (apex)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Apex
<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi> Ether Gland and Second Sight

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  The raw force of your will strikes far harder, physical blows can
  barely find you, and nothing stays hidden from your sight

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Barely made of matter, you draw little protection from armor and your
  physical strength wanes

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
